# `MaxTotalTargetCMC$ 3` (SpellAbility.java:1486-1497): a target is legal
# only while the mana values of the targets so far plus its own stay at 3 or
# less. Savannah Lions (1) and the first Grizzly Bears (2) fit; the second
# Grizzly Bears would make 5 and is dropped, so it stays in the graveyard
# while the other two return.
startturn ai
advance 3
tapformana ai 5 W
tapformana ai 6 W
tapformana ai 7 W
queue targets 1,2,4
queue paygeneric W
queue paygeneric W
queue action ai cast 3
passpriority
